The feature brings the dealership leads and gives buyers peace of mind, knowing they’ll get the car they want.

We started with a wireframe and turned it into a functional prototype, which let us test the usability of the reservation feature. Once the flow had been tested and proven to work, we added UX copy to guide users through the interface and polished the visual design to match the rest of the site.

From the very beginning, this new feature was built in close collaboration with the technical implementer, so that technical requirements and constraints were taken into account during the design phase.
